<!--
  Intentionally empty.

  These scripts are file-based C# apps, and a file-based app inherits Directory.Build.props from the
  directory of its .cs file upward, independently of the working directory. When the plugin is installed
  inside a user's repository, that repository's build settings would otherwise reach the scripts: a
  LangVersion below 8.0 alone stops them compiling. MSBuild stops at the first Directory.Build.props it
  finds walking up, so this file blocks the search.

  global.json is not inherited this way (the SDK is chosen from the working directory), and nuget.config
  does not matter because the scripts reference no packages.
-->
<Project />
